*HEADING
Cook's membrane: tapered panel clamped on its left edge, a uniform shear traction on
its right edge (*DSLOAD TRVEC, total load 1). Plane stress, E = 1, nu = 1/3,
thickness 1, 16 x 16 CPS8. Reference: the vertical displacement of the midpoint
C = (48, 52) of the loaded edge is 23.96 (Bergan & Felippa, CMAME 50, 1985).
** node (i, j) = 1 + j + 100 i: i = 0..32 across the panel, j = 0..32 up it
